{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837720/extras/b16119225f45e4f0c2f3462a3561277b.poster.avif?t=1768836614\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837720/extras/b16119225f45e4f0c2f3462a3561277b.webm?t=1768836614\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837720/extras/b16119225f45e4f0c2f3462a3561277b.mp4?t=1768836614\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u201cStop the invaders, cleanse the Corruption, and Pray to the Guardian Spirits\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRAY or DIE\u00a0</strong> is a tactical defence game about fight against greedy invaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, build defense towers, and harvest Faith at the temple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip weapons on your sailboat, and with help from the Guardian Sprits' power, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend the island in a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors-like, tower defense, MOBA, action roguelite. (Seriously.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837720/extras/d14bdf3d6dc7c78f40ad401445d92c47.avif?t=1768836614\" width=1560 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Who do you want to believe in?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waka'Tua</strong> - Guardian of abundance and dread, said to have shaped nature itself. He can spear lightning straight between an enemy\u2019s eyes, or give your sailboat a little \u201czap\u201d so it can sail fast across the sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mrrgur</strong> - The Guardian of corruption, born from pollution.\u00a0He can forcibly contaminate the island to gain resources, or foul the sea to devour your enemies. At times, even the invaders succumb to the lure of Corruption.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atheists</strong>- Some groups on the island believes that relying on Guardian Spirits is harmful to humans. They believes only sailboats and handmade weapons will save our island from the enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster from the Deep Sea</strong> - The colossal beast slumbering in the deep sea, with massive claws and terrifying fangs. Call its name with true sincerity and it will fight at your side.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many other Guardian Spirits to pray.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837720/extras/d14bdf3d6dc7c78f40ad401445d92c47.avif?t=1768836614\" width=1560 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guardian blessings that scale with your Faith!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite replayability!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more contents is planned for future updates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Which will you choose?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>PRAY OR DIE</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837720?t=1768836