\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837720/extras/d14bdf3d6dc7c78f40ad401445d92c47.avif?t=1768836614\" width=1560 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guardian blessings that scale with your Faith!!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite replayability!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more contents is planned for future updates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Which will you choose?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>PRAY OR DIE</i></strong></p>","developers":["Hyper-Ego Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837720/ff271374870c63a0da0fcd5c16d60ccb10b9d5fe/header.jpg?t=1768836614","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3837720/2139960327/e93b42fde33c6462ff00657b2b03c65714d78ccc/1755687287/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757342201","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3837720/2139960327/e93b42fde33c6462ff00657b2b03c65714d78ccc/1755687287/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757342201","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3837720/2139960327/e93b42fde33c6462